nk the future is  going to be good i think we just need to  get  past this last little bit with code  we're nearly out of time chris you want  to give a shout out to some of your  loyal customers for  being loyal to your business yeah  you know customers and community i mean  we're we're a tiny little business in  many ways we shouldn't still be here  we were massively under capitalized but  our community supported us that's why we  support them  and i i thank everyone who has helped us  out through some really tough times this  past year and a half  bill what about you and your customers  you want to give them some praise for  being loyal to you we've had a great run  ten years at dale's diner i've got 33  years at dale's bar and grill that's  still going strong it's still open and  running  to dale's diner customers hang in there  we're going to we're going to try to  open this thing up again  so so just hang in there we'll be back  chris montana bill anderson gentlemen  thanks so much our best to you  your families and your staff thanks mike  thanks for having us
 

